//@version=6
//
// OUR CODE: enters while flat and closes while long — the R4 closed-trade read-back probe
// (impl-Bp §3.9, impl-08 §3.7: closed_trade / closed_count).
strategy("rt close (strategy-pine R4)", overlay = true)
plot(close)
if strategy.position_size == 0
    strategy.entry("L", strategy.long)
else
    strategy.close("L")
